.SH "نام (NAME)"
timew-split \- split intervals
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
.nf
\fBtimew split\fP \fI<id>\fP\fB...\fP
.fi
.br
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Ѕplits an interval into two equally sized adjacent intervals, having the same tags.
Using the \*(Aqsummary\*(Aq command, and specifying the \*(Aq:ids\*(Aq hint shows interval IDs.
Using the right ID, you can identify an interval to split.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.sp
For example, show the IDs:
.sp
.if n .RS 4
.nf
.fam C
$ timew summary :week :ids
.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.sp
Then having selected \*(Aq@2\*(Aq as the interval you wish to split:
.sp
.if n .RS 4
.nf
.fam C
$ timew split @2
.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBtimew\-join\fP(1),
\fBtimew\-lengthen\fP(1),
\fBtimew\-shorten\fP(1)